# Local demo aid, not part of the stack: stubs the fetcher while eLitigation is
# in a maintenance window. Never commit it -- a checked-in override silently turns
# off real source fetching for everyone who runs `docker compose up`.
#
# Renamed from docker-compose.override.yml so compose stops AUTO-LOADING it (todo.md
# bug 8): as an override it beat .env and silently flipped a real stack to mock. Both
# names stay ignored -- the rename removed the ambush, not the reason to keep it local.
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.mockfetch.yml
